OL,3,GNEWSAFire service draft plan warns of  
OL,4,Aweather risks                          
OL,6,FFlooding, severe weather and wildlife  
OL,7,Fare among risks outlined by the States 
OL,8,Fof Jersey Fire and Rescue Service      
OL,9,F(SJFRS) in its draft plan.             
OL,11,FThe service has invited islanders to   
OL,12,Fhave their say on "priorities for      
OL,13,Fkeeping Jersey safe over the next four 
OL,14,Fyears" during an eight-week            
OL,15,Fconsultation.                          
OL,17,FThe plan outlines risks facing Jersey  
OL,18,Fand how SJFRS should use its people and
OL,19,Fresources to prevent emergencies,      
OL,20,Fprotect Islanders and respond when     
OL,21,Fincidents happen, it said.             
