OL,3,GNEWSAFire service draft plan warns of  
OL,4,Aweather risks                          
OL,6,FBen Elliott, station commander, said   
OL,7,FJersey was a "safe place" but the      
OL,8,Fservice faced changing risks and wanted
OL,9,Fto ensure its priorities "reflect what 
OL,10,Fmatters most to the community".        
